 109:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_dbg.c **** *\*\name    DBG_M7ConfigPeriph.
 110:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_dbg.c **** *\*\fun     Configures the specified peripheral run or stop when the M7 MCU under Debug mode.
 111:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_dbg.c **** *\*\param   DBG_Periph :
 112:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_dbg.c ****               - DBG_M7SLEEP               * Keep debugger connection during M7 SLEEP mode *
 113:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_dbg.c ****               - DBG_M7STOP                * Keep debugger connection during M7 STOP mode *
 114:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_dbg.c ****               - DBG_M7STANDBY             * Keep debugger connection during M7 STANDBY mode *
 115:../../../firmware/n32h7xx_std_periph_driver/src/n32h7xx_dbg.c ****               - DBG_WWDG1_STOP            * WWDG1 stopped when Core is halted. *
